!Name: p45forwrake-2
!C Period 45 c/3 forwards rake.
!C This puffer produces a forwards glider every 45 generations.
!C This uses a period 45 puffer whose output is perturbed by four period 3
!C edge-spark spaceships to produce a backwards travelling Herschel, which
!C first emits a output glider, and is then deleted by two small period 3 ships.
!C David I. Bell, August 1997
!Source: jslife-moving
!
